                                "sense_id": "58371948-5512-3749-843f-e2b1fda52645",
                                "text": "Linné discussed the strange “lamprey” with Norwegian Bishop and naturalist Johan Ernst Gunnerus and they both classified it as a worm. In 1763, Gunnerus wrote about the creature and he then referred to it as a Sleep-Marken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "865b8cf8-257a-43b2-8056-874f43e4a56e",
                                "sense_id": "58371948-5512-3749-843f-e2b1fda52645",
                                "text": "3. Myxine glutinosa [\"slepmark\" or \"pirål\" in Norwegian], which Gunnerus has dissected himself, and where he had clearly observed the difference between the sexes. [The article published by Gunnerus was, \"Om sleep-marken\"]."
                            }
                        ]
